      "text": "Annotations paired with WebMCP give your agents more context to act on.\n\nCheck out how @kagigz uses custom annotation controls and suggested prompts to help users edit scenes and update expenses in ChatGPT’s browser. https://t.co/VeHtq9DZ2S",
