      "text": "Here’s what our Codex Ambassadors have been up to:\n\nThey hosted Astra Commons, bringing people together in local cafés to share what they were making with Astra and try out ideas together.\n\nIn London, a meetup turned into a build challenge. Rohith made Forma, an animation tool",
